  "description": "ROHWET crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H68 F6 N10 O20 P2 Tb4 2+,2(Cl1 1-),0.38(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.068-4.245 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 112.05-118.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C55.62H70Cl2F6N10O20.38P2Tb4.",
